    "body_normalized": "## References\n\n- Fixes #16801\n- Closes https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/17074 (supersedes)\n\n## Code changes\nThese changes are up to the mark with WCAG AA contrast standards.\n1.Updated .jp-Shortcuts-Plus:hover : This also improves the readability and contrast both in light and dark mode\n2. Updated .jp-Shortcuts-Plus (Default State): This ensures better readability of the \"Add\" button in dark mode and light mode both.\n3.  Updated .jp-mod-selected-InputText : This improves contrast in both dark mode and light for selected input fields.\n## User-facing changes\n\n| State | Before | After |\n|--|--|--|\n| Normal, dark | ![dark theme before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/143e1f0a-3923-45d2-b5ee-1282e18004e9) | ![dark theme after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/438ac781-91b2-4967-b32c-e82f053265a7) |\n| Normal, light | ![light theme before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74cdd767-e9d1-414a-bb78-32a07e2bafd8) | ![ligth theme after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e020b52-5e7f-4a4a-86f0-2db25d34f80f) |\n| Hover, dark |![dark theme hover before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8415ae3a-64df-44fd-9fce-b19aab019d2f) | ![dark theme hover after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/939482df-cb75-4435-8f25-489698768a20) |\n| Hover, light | ![light theme hover before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8322a300-9879-4d7f-8cc5-d37ba5be155d) | ![light theme hover after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb675aac-b970-4ffc-b808-b0722e403a26) |\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNONE",
    "body_raw": "## References\r\n\r\n- Fixes #16801\r\n- Closes https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/17074 (supersedes)\r\n\r\n## Code changes\r\nThese changes are up to the mark with WCAG AA contrast standards.\r\n1.Updated .jp-Shortcuts-Plus:hover : This also improves the readability and contrast both in light and dark mode\r\n2. Updated .jp-Shortcuts-Plus (Default State): This ensures better readability of the \"Add\" button in dark mode and light mode both.\r\n3.  Updated .jp-mod-selected-InputText : This improves contrast in both dark mode and light for selected input fields.\r\n## User-facing changes\r\n\r\n| State | Before | After |\r\n|--|--|--|\r\n| Normal, dark | ![dark theme before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/143e1f0a-3923-45d2-b5ee-1282e18004e9) | ![dark theme after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/438ac781-91b2-4967-b32c-e82f053265a7) |\r\n| Normal, light | ![light theme before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74cdd767-e9d1-414a-bb78-32a07e2bafd8) | ![ligth theme after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e020b52-5e7f-4a4a-86f0-2db25d34f80f) |\r\n| Hover, dark |![dark theme hover before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8415ae3a-64df-44fd-9fce-b19aab019d2f) | ![dark theme hover after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/939482df-cb75-4435-8f25-489698768a20) |\r\n| Hover, light | ![light theme hover before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8322a300-9879-4d7f-8cc5-d37ba5be155d) | ![light theme hover after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb675aac-b970-4ffc-b808-b0722e403a26) |\r\n\r\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\r\n\r\nNONE\r\n",
